{"unit_id":"uugvkbvkdjbsdbvwxxl__dsh-plugin-web-annotate#card-zh","repo":"uugvkbvkdjbsdbvwxxl/dsh-plugin-web-annotate","commit":"00abe581cd6c0f9008d1fc35d38c6b259b7f4d70","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"网页批注（DSH 桌面版侧栏）：在内置浏览器中点选网页元素，为按钮、文字或其他界面内容写下修改意见，再把页面地址、可见文本和定位线索连同批注一次发送到当前会话。它接管侧栏中的浏览器入口，并提供批注模式、连续选取、编号高亮、暂停与恢复、明细编辑以及整批提交。会话中可将提交内容折叠为批注卡片，便于查看条目及其定位信息。适合需要针对正在浏览的网页提出具体界面修改意见，并希望模型据此查找项目源码的开发者。需要支持内置浏览器 guest bridge 的 DSH 桌面环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3210","client.js:2006","client.js:3102"]}
{"unit_id":"uugvkbvkdjbsdbvwxxl__dsh-plugin-web-annotate#card-en","repo":"uugvkbvkdjbsdbvwxxl/dsh-plugin-web-annotate","commit":"00abe581cd6c0f9008d1fc35d38c6b259b7f4d70","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Web Annotations (DSH desktop sidebar): Pick page elements, comment on them, and send their URLs and locator clues to the current session. It supports repeated picking, editable details, batch submission, and a collapsible conversation card. Requires the desktop browser bridge.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3210","client.js:2006","client.js:3102"]}
